>> title: Blue Cheese Dressing
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: blue cheese, buttermilk, salad, dip, no-cook
>> counters: Diner, Pizzeria, The Bowl Shop
>> aka: bleu cheese dressing, blue cheese dip, chunky blue cheese, side of blue cheese
>> servings: 10
>> time: 1 hr 10 min

>> step: mash chunky
Mash @blue cheese{4%oz}(115 g; crumbled) with @buttermilk{1/3%cup}(80 mL) and @white wine vinegar{1%Tbs} to a chunky paste.

>> step: whisk in
Whisk @mayonnaise{1/2%cup}(120 mL) and @sour cream{1/3%cup}(80 mL) into @&(~1)cheese{}.

>> step: season
Season @&(~1)dressing{} with @garlic{1%clove}(grated), @Worcestershire sauce{1/2%tsp}, @black pepper{1/2%tsp}, and @kosher salt{1/4%tsp}.

>> step: fold in, chill 1 hr
Fold @chives{2%Tbs}(sliced thin) into @&(~1)dressing{} and chill ~{1%hr}.
